**/package-lock.json
# Per-skill npm installs commit their package-lock.json so versions are
# deterministic (skillshub/<skill>/package.json declares deps;
# package-lock.json pins the resolved tree). Also commit the skillshub
# root lockfile (covers the rg + dugite + bots workspace tree).
!skillshub/package-lock.json
!skillshub/*/package-lock.json
# The unified-ui app commits its lockfile too (reproducible web + desktop builds).
!ui/unified-ui/package-lock.json
# The UI imports Apps SDK source, so its dependency tree must also be reproducible.
!sdk/typescript/package-lock.json
# The Phase 5G conformance guard (scripts/check_phase5g_conformance.py) reads this
# lockfile offline and pins the official runner's version + integrity, so it has to
# be committed rather than regenerated from the registry per clone.
!scripts/mcp-conformance/package-lock.json
