# Operator-supplied secrets + gws account list + OAuth client. Consumed
# at setup time by `make -C skillshub setup-env|setup-bot-envs|setup-
# gws-accounts` (via operator_config.py, which reads
# MAGICIAN_ROOT_DIR/operator-config.yaml first, then the legacy in-tree
# copy below), materialized into per-skill / per-bot env files and per-
# account auth dirs (themselves gitignored). Template lives at
# magician_data_v3/operator-config.template.yaml (committed) — copy to
# MAGICIAN_ROOT_DIR/operator-config.yaml and fill in. The OAuth desktop
# client JSON (client_secret.json) reads from MAGICIAN_ROOT_DIR first, then
# the in-tree skillshub/ copy below.
skillshub/operator-config.yaml
skillshub/client_secret.json
# Legacy operator files (pre-consolidation). Still ignored so lingering
# copies on developer machines don't accidentally land in git.
.env.copy.development
.env copy.development
