# Generated codegraph artifacts — regenerated by `make graph-index` (see
# scripts/codegraph_exclude.txt). Large + churny (graph.json ~78MB, exceeds
# GitHub's 50MB limit); kept on disk for the cgraph_* MCP tools but not tracked.
# The static explorer UI, mcp_server.py, cgraph CLI, and vendor/ under
# docs/codegraph/ stay tracked. Fresh clones run `make graph-index` to populate.
docs/codegraph/graph.json
