ui/unified-ui/static/vosk/model.tar.gz

# Magios ambient-mode wake spotter: the iOS libvosk static archive (~164 MB) and
# the unpacked ~68 MB model are fetched + checksummed by
# `make setup-magios-vosk`. The hand-written header + module map beside the
# xcframework ARE committed — they are 3 KB and they are what makes a missing
# fetch a clear link error instead of a parse error in every file.
magios/Vendor/vosk/libvosk.xcframework/
magios/Magios/Resources/vosk-model/
# The qualification worktree may provision these as symlinks to an existing
# verified download; directory-only patterns above do not match symlink nodes.
magios/Vendor/vosk/libvosk.xcframework
magios/Magios/Resources/vosk-model

